  solving row 54112: range cannot be determined from the supplied arguments (too many NAs)<br>In addition: Warning messages:<br>1: In eval(expr, envir, enclos) :<br>  inaccurate integer conversion in coercion<br>2: In .Method(..., deparse.level = deparse.level) :<br>  number of rows of result is not a multiple of vector length (arg 2)<br>3: In rep.ref$V2 + b.start.size[, 1] + b.start.size[, 2] :<br>  NAs produced by integer overflow<br><br>The bed file was downloaded from <a href=\"http://bioviz.org/quickload/A_thaliana_Jun_2009/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioviz.org/quickload/A_thaliana_Jun_2009/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793233310768000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06-0kmkgY3AcnERY0gWMeG\">http://bioviz.org/quickload/A_thaliana_Jun_2009/</a><br><br><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Thanks <br>Amrita<br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
